==Animated Enemy Bases==
:''Main article: [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Enemy Bases]].''
'''Animated Enemy Bases''' are counted as [[Enemy Units]] with their own IDs, and many also possess the ability to attack [[Cat Units]]. Unlike other bases, their health is determined by a strength magnification which also affects their damage output, and the vast majority of them can receive damage from [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s. Crown difficulties will increase the strength magnifications of these bases.

==Base Barrier==
:''Main article: [[Base Barrier]].''
[[:Category:Stages with Base Barriers|Certain stages]] will have the enemy base protected by a '''Base Barrier''' that renders the enemy base completely invulnerable to attack until the stage's designated boss enemy has been defeated, effectively preventing "cheesing" of the stage by destroying the base before fighting the boss. If the boss has not spawned yet and spawns on a timer, the Base Barrier will be present beforehand; otherwise, it will be absent until the base takes enough damage to spawn the linked boss.

The Base Barrier is visually identical to the [[Barrier]] used by [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]], but is colored green instead of red. When the linked boss is defeated, it will shatter like a Barrier hit by a [[Barrier Breaker]] attack.

